{'symbol': 'IPG', 'date': '2022-05-19 14:04:00', 'title': 'INTERPUBLIC NAMES CHANNING MARTIN GLOBAL CHIEF DIVERSITY AND SOCIAL IMPACT OFFICER', 'text': "NEW YORK, NY, MAY 19, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- INTERPUBLIC GROUP (NYSE: IPG) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT CHANNING MARTIN IS JOINING THE COMPANY AS GLOBAL CHIEF DIVERSITY AND SOCIAL IMPACT OFFICER, EFFECTIVE IMMEDIATELY. MARTIN WILL BE RESPONSIBLE FOR ADVANCING IPG'S DIVERSITY, EQUITY AND INCLUSION OBJECTIVES AND CONTINUING TO STRENGTHEN THE COMPANY'S PROGRESS TO BEING ONE OF THE WORLD'S MOST DIVERSE AND INCLUSIVE COMPANIES."}